  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Finely chop garlic.\n• In a medium saucepan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium heat. Cook half the garlic until fragrant, 1-2 minutes.\n• Add basmati rice, the water (for the rice) and a generous pinch of salt and bring to the boil. Reduce heat to low, then cover with a lid. Cook for 10 minutes, then remove from heat.\n• Keep covered until rice is tender and water is absorbed, 10 minutes. TIP: The rice will finish cooking in its own steam, so don't peek!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-64e2ae07dd7d57f2ca82c085-0879ff67.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While the rice is cooking, drain sweetcorn.\n• Drain and rinse red kidney beans.\n• Grate carrot. Set aside.\n• Heat a large frying pan over high heat. Cook corn kernels until lightly browned, 4-5 minutes. Transfer to a medium bowl.\n• While the corn is cooking, roughly chop baby spinach leaves and tomato.\n• Thinly slice red onion TIP: Cover the pan with a lid if the corn kernels are 'popping' out.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-64e2ae07dd7d57f2ca82c085-e20be58e.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a small heatproof bowl, combine onion, the white wine vinegar, a splash of water and a good pinch of sugar and salt.\n• Microwave the pickled onion mixture in 30 second bursts, until softened.\n• To the bowl with the charred corn, add spinach and tomato. Drizzle with olive oil. Toss to combine. Season with salt and pepper to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-64e2ae07dd7d57f2ca82c085-28ac68a1.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Return frying pan to medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil.\n• Cook carrot, stirring, until tender, 2-3 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-64e2ae07dd7d57f2ca82c085-b03bad17.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• SPICY! The spice blend is mild, but use less if you're sensitive to heat. Add Tex-Mex spice blend, tomato paste and remaining garlic and cook until fragrant, 1-2 minutes.\n• Stir in kidney beans, mild chipotle sauce (see ingredients), the water (for the beans), the brown sugar and the plant-based butter. Simmer until slightly thickened, 1-2 minutes.\n• Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-64e2ae07dd7d57f2ca82c085-ce4776e2.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide garlic rice between bowls. Top with beans.\n• Serve with charred corn salsa.\n• Top with pickled onion.\n• Sprinkle over plant-based grated cheese to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-64e2ae07dd7d57f2ca82c085-694652b8.jpeg"
    }
  ]
}
